SUMMARY:Burning of Judas\, Perdika
LOCATION:Perdika\, Aegina\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On Easter Sunday evening (6.30 pm) the fishing village of Perdika revives the burning of Judas: a procession from the primary school down to the harbour\, where the effigy goes up in flames\, the Vathy cultural association dances and the tavernas and locals hand out treats. Perdika's quay is the best place on Aegina for an Easter Sunday fish dinner anyway.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/aegina/#perdika-burning-of-judas-perdika
